<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-STATISTICS OF KAFELNIKOV V PIOLINE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-STATISTICS OF KAFELNIKOV V PIOLINE.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics of Friday's French Open men's singles third round match between third seed Yevgeny Kafelnikov of Russia and Cedric Pioline of France:</p>
<p>Kafelnikov won 7-5 6-4 6-7 (3-7) 1-6 6-4</p>
<p>Time: three hours 31 minutes</p>
<p>KAFELNIKOV (3)    PIOLINE (33)</p>
<p>Aces 4 15</p>
<p>Double faults 6 5</p>
<p>Percentage first serves 65 71</p>
<p>Forehand winners 13 17</p>
<p>Backhand winners 13 5</p>
<p>Unforced errors 79 77</p>
<p>Break points 24 16</p>
<p>Breaks of serve 7 6</p>
</text>
